				},
				{
					"id": 718080302,
					"content": "关于南天门的情况…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718080303,
					"content": "地震、魔物，还有个小女孩…是谁家孩子走失了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉义"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080304,
					"content": "关于小女孩说的话…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080305
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718080305,
					"content": "那个孩子说什么了？「那位」的复苏？见证？这都什么乱七八糟的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉义"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080306,
					"content": "准是又看了什么奇奇怪怪的书…算了，我马上去安排人，把那孩子带回城里来。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉义"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080307,
					"content": "又是地震又是魔物，那孩子可别被伤着了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉义"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080308,
					"content": "谢谢你，这些东西请你收下吧，辛苦你帮我跑这一趟了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718080309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "嘉义"
				},
				{
					"id": 718080309,
					"content": "唉，事情真是只多不少…",
